WEBVTT

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:16.000
I'll ward off pressure by myself.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.990
As I am the daughter of Kuonji Banshou.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.520
Shinra-sama, good morning.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.360
Was she working all night?

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.930
A father... huh.

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.530
What are you doing?

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:54.070
Shinra-sama...

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.510
Uesugi Ren is fired.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:41.510
Huh?

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:46.760
Very well. If Ren-chan's going, then I'm quitting.

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:49.010
Mihato, don't jump to conclusions.

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:51.400
Nee-san, explain why.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:57.510
There is no need to retain a butler who interferes with his master's work.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.110
That should be enough of a reason.

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:03.610
N-No objections.

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:06.280
Shinra-sama, it's time to go.

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:08.250
Understood.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.630
She's at a crucial point right before the memorial concert.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.010
Kid, stay out of trouble.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:30.360
Ren-chan, what happened?

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:35.860
Well, I got carried away during my date with Shinra-sama, and made her upset.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.470
Is that really all?

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.360
I've had enough of you!

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:48.000
Getting drunk all the time and hurting people...

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.330
...is that all you can do?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.870
Whoa, scary. Are you trying to act cool?

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.270
What did you say?

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:57.040
You talk big...

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:02.260
...but you're no different from me in your destructive and violent manners.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:09.760
I...

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.890
Come back home with Mihato.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.730
Who's going to return to a place like that?

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.460
When I've finally found it,

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.540
a home I look forward to return to.

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:20.750
Is that so?

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:22.110
In that case, it can't be helped.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:27.120
Since my son and daughter are being taken care of,
as a father, I must extend my greetings.

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:38.420
Don't...

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:42.650
That house isn't a place where you can set foot in!

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:45.680
I'll leave for now.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:49.680
I'm staying at a hotel nearby, so call me on my cell phone.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.770
My number hasn't changed.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:56.000
Let's live together again and have fun, the three of us.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:01.980
Why... does someone like that have to be my father?

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.070
If it only wasn't for him...

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.460
Ren-chan?

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:08.030
It's really nothing.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.040
Sorry, Hato-nee.

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:14.420
Ren.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.260
M-Miyu-san.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.560
I... that is...

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:22.050
You and Mihato better not jump the gun.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:29.000
The Kuonji family won't forsake someone they consider to be a family member just because of one or two blunders.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:36.850
This time, let's not take risks and play it safe.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:47.150
You don't get it, do you?

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:03.670
Welcome home, Shin Onee-chan!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.490
Here.

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:08.550
My, you're quite stiff.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.140
Yume might not have enough strength to loosen you up.

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.740
I guess you need to be a man to do it.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.000
"Call for Ren."

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.000
Did you want me to say that?

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:21.400
I'm tired and I don't want to talk about such things.

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:24.570
You're right. I'm sorry.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:33.620
But, you seem to be uptight these days,
not acting like the Shin Onee-chan I know of.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.010
Not acting like myself?

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:40.180
Nee-san.

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:42.530
If it's about Ren...

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:45.630
I'm not wearing any underwear.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:46.640
What?

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:51.590
If you nullify Ren's termination...

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:54.510
You can do what you want with me.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.500
S-Stop!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.000
That's so unlike of Miyu-tan!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.110
The pleasure of Miyu-tan teasing is to force things on you!

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:08.510
Not that this doesn't pique my curiosity, but...

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.070
...still, you can't!

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:14.620
To turn down my offer... Nee-san, you've changed.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:19.020
Why are you and Yume going that far?

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.790
Is Ren that dear to you?

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:26.840
Yeah, his frank attitude is so pleasing,
I feel as if I can be naked, not having to hide anything.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:28.840
You're always like that.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:33.550
Nee-san, you should stop acting stubborn and open up.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.000
I've changed?

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:58.250
Why did I do such a stupid thing?

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:03.770
When you were always trying to make your master's wishes come true...

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.240
The real Shinra-sama is...

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:10.780
...shouldering the responsibilities of the family,
the expectations and criticisms of the outer world...

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:13.720
All of the burden by yourself.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:18.430
Won't I be able to support your soul?

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.930
I feel as if I understand your feelings, Shinra-sama.

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:27.330
You can understand my feelings?

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:28.730
Don't say such irresponsible things!

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:33.260
Shinra-sama, you must do things the way you can only do...

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:35.120
You talk casually.

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:49.210
Was that what I wanted?

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:57.000
In light of everyone's request, Uesugi Ren's firing will be put on hold.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:58.510
Really?

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.260
Aren't you glad, Ren-kun?

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.020
Wonderful! I feel like I'm in heaven!

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:07.730
A wise decision.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.980
Thanks, Shin Onee-chan!

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:14.240
However, if there are no signs of improvement,
you'll be axed nonetheless.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.910
Banzai! Banzai!

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:18.610
Rest assured. I will re-educate him.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:22.660
You don't have to be uptight. Just do your job as you have in the past.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.530
All this for my sake...

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.600
Thank you, everybody!

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.170
Now, now, Ren-kun!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.000
You don't have to cry.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.250
It's something to cheer about, so show a smile!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.670
Yes, you're right!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:38.380
Hey, just when I thought you were being humble,
you're back to your old stupid self!

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:53.500
I have to protect them from him.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.740
Hato-nee and everyone in this house.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.700
Did you call for me, Shinra-sama?

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:06.240
Sorry for what happened.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:06.700
Huh?

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:11.710
Just like you said, I was irritated by the pressure of the show.

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:14.020
Shinra-sama, it's not your fault.

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:16.300
I didn't mind my words.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.500
Are you concerned about something?

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.180
Keeping things to yourself isn't a good thing.

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:21.860
It's nothing.

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:24.230
I heard you were staring at your cell phone.

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:26.870
Were you waiting for the results of a job interview?

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.000
No, it's not that!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.000
I want to remain here forever!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:30.810
That's why...

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:32.250
What are you hiding from me?

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.010
N-Nothing...

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:35.440
Look at me and answer.

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:40.280
Shinra-sama, I don't want to cause you trouble when the concert is approaching.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.800
I see. You may go.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:54.270
If you were only honest with me, you'd be more lovable.

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:02.010
Tomorrow night is Shinra-sama's concert.

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:05.260
I have to settle it by then.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:19.530
Haru, I'll take care of the outdoor duties.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:23.490
As soon as I'm finished with this, I'm going to make the call.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:25.240
Yo.

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:27.550
Old man...

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:31.250
I thought you might have forgotten my number,
so I have come to pay a visit.

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:37.230
Let's go somewhere we can talk in private.

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:42.980
So that guy's the one responsible for Ren's queer actions.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:44.350
What should we do?

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:45.530
What else?

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:46.250
Follow them.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.440
Shinra-sama...

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:52.850
Let's get on with the main topic.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:57.990
Go home... please!

00:11:57.990 --> 00:12:01.140
I can't hear your murmurs.

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:03.950
Hato-nee and I won't go back home!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.070
What did you say?

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.360
You stinking punk!

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:11.330
You're forgetting the debt you owe me for raising you!

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:15.560
I've repaid you for that a long time ago!

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:19.000
Forcing me to work and being hit everyday...

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.710
Well, it isn't enough!

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:22.930
So that's Ren's father, huh.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:25.330
He's more of a scum than what I heard.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:27.720
That idiot... what is he doing?

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:30.770
Hurry up and fight back!

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.730
Oh, are you his acquaintance?

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:33.760
Ren!

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:41.010
Don't... please... I'll do anything you say...

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:42.280
I'm sorry...

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.260
Hey...

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.990
You have to discipline kids by hitting them.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.240
If you get the message, then bring over Mihato!

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:56.140
Ren. don't go.

00:12:56.140 --> 00:13:00.760
But, if I don't... I'll cause trouble for Shinra-sama and everyone...

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:03.760
In the end, I can't turn against the old man...

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:06.760
Then, why did you lecture me in the first place?!

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:10.630
Were your comments about a father having nothing to do with it, no matter who he is,

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:14.650
and that you must do things in the way you only can... were they all lies?

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:15.770
I'm sorry...

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:17.770
I...

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.480
Were you lying when you said you would support me?

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:24.750
I'm going to do things the way I want to.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:25.700
Huh?

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.200
What do you want to do?

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:29.030
I...

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.730
Ignoring me all this time... what's with you, bitch?

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:32.620
Shithead!

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:36.000
You fucking bitch...

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.490
You piss me off!

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:39.290
That's my line!

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:40.510
Beni!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:46.510
That goes for you, too!

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.990
My sister's doctrine:

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:51.890
"A man must protect a woman"!

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:53.270
This can't be...

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:56.750
Any man who hits a woman is a scum!

00:13:58.220 --> 00:13:59.650
You brat!

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.270
And scums must be dealt with!

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:08.490
I wished that one day you'd pull yourself together.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:09.950
Back when I was a kid.

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:14.350
That's kind of difficult.

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.390
Because, every time I see your face, I get pissed.

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:21.720
In that case, I'll make sure you'll never see it again!

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:22.660
Ren!

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:25.420
What's the matter?

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:26.290
Do it.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:31.010
I'm... different from you.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.760
No, you're not.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.720
Don't think you're the only one who's going to be happy.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:38.400
There's no way you can be happy alone.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:53.160
Ren is the butler of the Kuonji family.

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:56.490
I'm no longer a kid who you can order at will.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.270
Are you going to desert me?

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:02.500
You're the only lineage I have in this world, you know.

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:05.500
My family is here!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:08.170
This way, everybody!

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:09.980
Ren-kun, are you all right?

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:12.180
My soul mate, I've come to save you!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.480
You guys...

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:18.180
I called for Natose as insurance, but it seems like everyone came to your aid.

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:23.960
Do as you please.

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:24.950
Old man...

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.730
It's payback time for what you did to me!

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:36.240
Teach him a painful lesson about the consequences of marring your beauty, Beni.

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:39.740
Shinra-sama, it's time to go to the rehearsal.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:42.130
Oh, is it time already?

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:43.290
Let's go, Ren.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:44.040
Yes.

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:48.050
Shin Onee-chan, good luck!

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:52.000
That brat sure outdistanced me.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:57.640
If you wanted to keep him at your side,
why did you abuse him?

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:58.940
Mihato...

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:03.100
Will you promise never to raise your hand again?

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:06.290
So, when are you coming back?

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:10.570
If you're not there, I don't have anyone to do the cooking and laundry for me.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.280
You never learn, do you?

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:16.990
Whoa, you sound just like your mother.

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.890
Such a sad person.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:25.330
Acting tough and relying on intimidation and violence,
and being forsaken by the people around him.

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:30.280
For a little girl, you act mighty big.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:31.550
Call me "lady".

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.420
De Niro, it's punishment time!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:37.170
Super Electromagnetic Massage!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:39.050
Translator's note: Parody of "Choudenji Robo Combattler V",
in which De Niro's VA Tatekabe Kazuya voices Nishikawa Daisaku.

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:43.240
This is for good measure!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:53.570
Are you now feeling true to yourself?

00:16:56.070 --> 00:17:00.280
When he left, it was the first time I felt lonely.

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:04.750
Since he was the only person who stayed by my side.

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:09.790
I will let you see him again, that is, if you become a decent father.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:10.730
Huh?

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:13.970
Moderate your alcohol consumption, do not use violence,

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.300
and work diligently.

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:17.800
Can you promise me that?

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:26.000
I'm sorry for the last minute changes, but...

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:29.310
I felt I should incorporate the expressions that you requested.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:37.270
Don't be afraid of mistakes, and let's enjoy it.

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:54.720
This is who I am.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:57.070
Not the daughter of Kuonji Banshou.

00:17:57.070 --> 00:18:00.000
But Kuonji Shinra.

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:16.340
Yes, this is your sound.

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:19.240
Not anybody else's, but yours, Shinra.

00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:56.000
Shinra-sama, it was a huge success-

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.300
It's because of you, Ren.

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:11.500
That was your reward.

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.740
I must deliver an encore.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:27.430
Morning!

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:33.150
Don't try to deceive me with a cheerful greeting!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.620
Lock the door, then!

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:37.360
What's the matter, Beni?

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:39.770
R-Ren-kun...

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:44.870
Translator's note: Reference to Kerorin, a pharmaceutical company known for their Kerorin brand washing pails.

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:48.370
Sorry for exposing something indecent!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:52.580
My, my.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:57.690
If you can't hold it back... you're supposed to tell Onee-chan, right?

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:58.590
N-No!

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:02.760
I'm sorry...

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:05.800
You're apologizing to the wrong person!

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:12.470
I'm quite moved...

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:13.450
Good timing, Ren.

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:13.940
Huh?

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:15.340
Take off your clothes.

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:15.940
Huh?

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:20.110
I-Is this all right?

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.740
You look great, just as I thought!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.140
Next will be the song and choreography.

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:27.530
If you make a mistake...

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:34.800
Finished, at last...

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:35.540
Huh?

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:38.410
In that case, come to my room, Ren.

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:41.250
Ren-kun, what about your promise to read manga with Yume?

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:43.990
It's Onee-chan's turn, you know!

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:47.740
Isn't it about time to decide on whom you're going to serve exclusively?

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:49.760
U-Um... I...

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:03.490
Yikes, Ageha-sama?

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:12.920
If it's a battle for authority over Ren, then I will join the fray!

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:17.170
Your token of loyalty.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:21.250
Ageha-sa...

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:27.510
He's mine!

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.740
What are you saying in the heat of the moment?

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:32.440
Um... Yume also... that is...

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.000
Yume, fight for it!

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.500
Go for it, Miyu!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.270
Shinra-sama, don't lose!

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.640
Yo, what's the commotion?

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:41.060
A battle for the title of queen?

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:44.720
Well, the usual stuff.

00:22:06.060 --> 00:22:07.010
Yo.

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:08.090
Yeah.

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:41.380
Ageha-sama!

00:23:23.120 --> 00:23:25.010
Miyu-tan, slurp, slurp.

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:28.680
Stare...

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:31.250
Yummy!

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:33.460
Yume's so cute, yet...

00:23:37.130 --> 00:23:39.710
I want to be fondled by Shinra-sama, too!

00:23:39.710 --> 00:23:41.280
Well, whatever.

00:23:41.280 --> 00:23:44.940
In any case, this place is getting more and more comfortable!

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:53.150
How about serving me, along with Ren?

00:23:53.750 --> 00:23:55.870
I am a member of the Kuonji family.

00:23:59.780 --> 00:24:02.250
There's no place like home.

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:03.800
I agree.
